[B]ROM:[/B] CyanogenMod 7
[B]Device:[/B] Huawei Y210
[B]Android version:[/B] 2.3.7 Gingerbread
[B]Status:[/B] Alpha
[B]Build:[/B] cm-7-20260411-UNOFFICIAL-y210.zip
[B]MD5:[/B] 976205cfd4abd100548cf67261364cc5

[B]What works:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Display and touchscreen
[*]Multitouch (Type A)
[*]Physical keys (power/vol+/vol-) + capacitive keys (back/home/menu)
[*]Brightness control + RGB notification LED
[*]Audio playback and voice recording
[*]Bluetooth bring-up
[*]Wi-Fi bring-up, scanning and connection
[*]Basic boot, UI, and system services
[*]Calls (in/out) and SMS (send/receive)
[*]SD card mount + USB mass storage
[/LIST]

[B]Known issues:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Mobile data not validated yet (APN + real IP session)
[*]Camera lifecycle is still fragile: first preview works, but reopen / release can break mediaserver
[*]Camera capture still not working
[*]Wi-Fi framework scan delivery was fragile during bring-up and should be re-validated on each build
[*]FM radio app crashes (missing `acquireFdNative` JNI stack)
[*]SIM Toolkit (STK) menu may not show / may hang (depends on SIM proactive commands)
[*]Headset volume perceived lower than stock (tuning pending)
[*]GPS fix not validated yet
[/LIST]

[B]Changelog (2026-04-11):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]RIL stabilized: baseband/IMEI/calls/SMS working
[*]Audio HAL runtime data fixed (filters + libaudioeq) and headset post-proc knob added
[*]Device function matrix + consistent logging notes added in the device tree
[/LIST]

[B]Hardware notes (Y210):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]No proximity sensor
[*]No ambient light sensor
[*]Accelerometer: LIS3DH (gravity + linear acceleration are virtual)
[/LIST]

[B]Installation:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Make a full backup from recovery.
[*]Wipe data / factory reset.
[*]Flash the ROM zip.
[*]Flash Google Apps if your build requires them.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

[B]Update from previous build:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Wipe cache / dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the new build.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

